

Statement of work (SOW)

- Document that outlines the details of the project which includes the scope, cost, requirements, deliverables and time. 

Master Service Agreement (MSA)

- A contract that defines terms and conditions are established under which services will be provided

Service Level Agreement (SLA)

- A contract that defines the level of service expected from the service provider

Business Partnership Agreement (BPA)

- An agreement that defines the relationship & responsibilities between business partners

